# bitcoin/bips (BSD-2-Clause, as BIP340's header states), shallow: test data,
# never compiled. A test that names bips reads BIP340's
# bip-0340/test-vectors.csv and BIP341's bip-0341/wallet-test-vectors.json
# from the directory WEBCPP_TEST_BIPS names, with forward slashes, the
# directory given to wasmtime on WASI (webcpp.data), and runs again when one
# of the two files changes.
